ائي يحدد الثابت.","En":"Integrate to recover the function; the initial condition determines the constant."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نكامل الطرف الأيمن فنحصل على $y=4x+C$.","En":"Integrate the right-hand side to obtain $y=4x+C$."},{"Ar":"من $y(0)=3$ نجد $C=3$، فنعوض $x=5$ في الحل.","En":"From $y(0)=3$ we get $C=3$, then substitute $x=5$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$23$","En":"$23$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تنس ثابت التكامل أو التعويض بالشرط الابتدائي.","En":"Do not omit the integration constant or initial condition."},"FormulaLatex":"y(x)=y(0)+\\int_0^x g(t)\\,dt","Substitution":{"Ar":"$y(5)=4(5)+3=20+3=23$","En":"$y(5)=4(5)+3=20+3=23$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(4x+3)'=4,\\quad y(0)=3$","En":"$(4x+3)'=4,\\quad y(0)=3$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"بعد تحديد الجزء المتغير $20$، فإن اختيار $24$ يستلزم قيمة ابتدائية $4$ بدلاً من $3$، فلا يحقق الشرط.","En":"With variable part $20$, choice $24$ would require initial value $4$ rather than $3$, violating the condition."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"بعد تحديد الجزء المتغير $20$، فإن اختيار $26$ يستلزم قيمة ابتدائية $6$ بدلاً من $3$، فلا يحقق الشرط.","En":"With variable part $20$, choice $26$ would require initial value $6$ rather than $3$, violating the condition."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"misconception","Reason":{"Ar":"بعد تحديد الجزء المتغير $20$، فإن اختيار $21$ يستلزم قيمة ابتدائية $1$ بدلاً من $3$، فلا يحقق الشرط.","En":"With variable part $20$, choice $21$ would require initial value $1$ rather than $3$, violating the condition."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نستخدم التكامل لاستعادة الدالة من مشتقتها، والشرط الابتدائي يحدد الثابت.

$y(x)=y(0)+\int_0^x g(t)\,dt$

1. نكامل الطرف الأيمن فنحصل على $y=4x+C$.

2. من $y(0)=3$ نجد $C=3$، فنعوض $x=5$ في الحل.

$y(5)=4(5)+3=20+3=23$

$23$ بلا وحدة قياس

$(4x+3)'=4,\quad y(0)=3$

لا تنس ثابت التكامل أو التعويض بالشرط الابتدائي.$mw$,$mw$Integrate to recover the function; the initial condition determines the constant.

$y(x)=y(0)+\int_0^x g(t)\,dt$

1. Integrate the right-hand side to obtain $y=4x+C$.

2. From $y(0)=3$ we get $C=3$, then substitute $x=5$.

$y(5)=4(5)+3=20+3=23$

$23$ Dimensionless

$(4x+3)'=4,\quad y(0)=3$

Do not omit the integration constant or initial condition.$mw$),
(554,348,$mw$BE0183AD21A592AC5EAF1416E6154C14642DE159493A465C3BDB3BB693AB4F1B$mw$,$mw$23c7ead2917ea6863e7ed0adedb6c1b1$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":348,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":15,"Points":15,"TitleAr":"إذا \\(y''=0\\) و\\(y'(0)=3\\) و\\(y(0)=4\\)، أوجد \\(y(4)\\).","TitleEn":"Given \\(y''=0\\), \\(y'(0)=3\\), \\(y(0)=4\\), find \\(y(4)\\).","QuestionTextAr":"إذا \\(y''=0\\) و\\(y'(0)=3\\) و\\(y(0)=4\\)، أوجد \\(y(4)\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Given \\(y''=0\\), \\(y'(0)=3\\), \\(y(0)=4\\), find \\(y(4)\\).","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: إذا كانت المشتقة الثانية y″ = 0، فالمشتقة الأولى ثابتة y′ = C₁ والدالة خطية y = C₁x + C₂. من y′(0) = 3 نجد C₁ = 3، ومن y(0) = 4 نجد C₂ = 4. إذن y(4) = 3 × 4 + 4 = 16.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: If y″ = 0, then y′ is constant and y(x) = C₁x + C₂. The conditions y′(0) = 3 and y(0) = 4 yield C₁ = 3, C₂ = 4. Thus y(4) = 3 × 4 + 4 = 16. Differentiate twice to check that y″ = 0.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1381,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"19","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1382,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"14","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1383,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"16","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1384,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"17","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"تحتاج إلى تكاملين لأن المعادلة من الرتبة الثانية.","En":"Two integrations are needed because the equation is second order."},{"Ar":"حدد ثابت كل تكامل باستعمال الشرط الابتدائي الموافق له.","En":"Determine each integration constant using the corresponding initial condition."}],"Title":{"Ar":"إذا \\(y''=0\\) و\\(y'(0)=3\\) و\\(y(0)=4\\)، أوجد \\(y(4)\\).","En":"Given \\(y''=0\\), \\(y'(0)=3\\), \\(y(0)=4\\), find \\(y(4)\\)."},"Points":15,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"بعد تحديد الجزء المتغير $12$، فإن اختيار $19$ يستلزم قيمة ابتدائية $7$ بدلاً من $4$، فلا يحقق الشرط.","En":"With variable part $12$, choice $19$ would require initial value $7$ rather than $4$, violating the condition."},"ErrorType":"misconception","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode"